From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tom Ballard <tom.ballard08@googlemail.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 19:34:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: input: apple,z2-multitouch: Add iPad mini 4

The iPad mini 4 (J96) has the N1 touchscreen controller of the iPad 5
and iPad Air 2, with the same kind of supplies and clock: an LDO enable
GPIO, a PMIC analog supply and the PMGR touch clock. Like the Air 2, it
leaves display sync as iBoot set it, so it describes no display-sync pin
states.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 .../bindings/input/touchscreen/apple,z2-multitouch.yaml         | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/input/touchscreen/apple,z2-multitouch.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/input/touchscreen/apple,z2-multitouch.yaml
index 0d508131f..b9d5dce04 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/input/touchscreen/apple,z2-multitouch.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/input/touchscreen/apple,z2-multitouch.yaml
@@ -20,6 +20,7 @@ properties:
       - apple,j71b-touchscreen
       - apple,j71t-touchscreen
       - apple,j81-touchscreen
+      - apple,j96-touchscreen
       - apple,j172-touchscreen
       - apple,d11-touchscreen
       - apple,d111-touchscreen
@@ -183,6 +184,7 @@ allOf:
           enum:
             - apple,j71t-touchscreen
             - apple,j81-touchscreen
+            - apple,j96-touchscreen
     then:
       properties:
         pinctrl-names:
